{
    "title": "Derailed: Wild Quest",
    "description": "Craft your own destiny as you embark on an epic journey through a world ravaged by the apocalypse\r\n\r\nIn this action packed adventure game, you control the fate of humanity from the helm of your trusty locomotive. You\u2019ll be wise to remember the only rule here is survival and every decision you make could be the difference between life and death. \r\n\r\nAs a global explorer, you'll gather precious resources, complete daring quests, and battle ferocious enemies in your quest to become a hero that this planet so desperately needs.\r\n\r\nBut fear not! You won't be alone on this odyssey. Hire companions who will join your train adventure, lending their unique skills to aid in your fight for survival. Join forces to discover new locations and search for ways to save the little planet that remains. Together, you'll navigate through treacherous terrain, defend against savage threats, and uncover the secrets hidden within this wrecked world.\r\n\r\nWill you rise to the challenge and become the saviour of your own world, or will you succumb to the danger that lies ahead and let it fall to inevitable destruction? The choice is yours in this ultimate adventure!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nAll Aboard! : Hop into your own locomotive as you travel through the post-apocalyptic landscape.\r\nLocation Exploration: Unlock and explore new locations as you uncover valuable resources along the way.\r\nResource Gathering: Scavenge for essential resources to keep your train and companions running in the unforgiving wilderness.\r\nExciting Quests: Challenge yourself with new quests each with its own rewards and consequences.\r\nFind Companions: Recruit companions to join you on your journey, each with their own skills to help you along the way.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Craft your own destiny as you embark on an epic journey through a world ravaged by the apocalypse<br><br>In this action packed adventure game, you control the fate of humanity from the helm of your trusty locomotive. You\u2019ll be wise to remember the only rule here is survival and every decision you make could be the difference between life and death. <br><br>As a global explorer, you&#39;ll gather precious resources, complete daring quests, and battle ferocious enemies in your quest to become a hero that this planet so desperately needs.<br><br>But fear not! You won&#39;t be alone on this odyssey. Hire companions who will join your train adventure, lending their unique skills to aid in your fight for survival. Join forces to discover new locations and search for ways to save the little planet that remains. Together, you&#39;ll navigate through treacherous terrain, defend against savage threats, and uncover the secrets hidden within this wrecked world.<br><br>Will you rise to the challenge and become the saviour of your own world, or will you succumb to the danger that lies ahead and let it fall to inevitable destruction? The choice is yours in this ultimate adventure!<br><br>Features:<br>All Aboard! : Hop into your own locomotive as you travel through the post-apocalyptic landscape.<br>Location Exploration: Unlock and explore new locations as you uncover valuable resources along the way.<br>Resource Gathering: Scavenge for essential resources to keep your train and companions running in the unforgiving wilderness.<br>Exciting Quests: Challenge yourself with new quests each with its own rewards and consequences.<br>Find Companions: Recruit companions to join you on your journey, each with their own skills to help you along the way.",
